DESCRIPTION:Have questions about your tablet\, phone\, laptop\, email or a
 n app? Need help with ebooks or other online library services?\nOur staff 
 are here to teach you technology tools and concepts in a friendly and casu
 al setting. Please bring your personal device and any questions you may ha
 ve.\n2:30-3:00pm - DROP-IN session only!
LOCATION:Rexdale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d920ca129f12743837b776
