DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260615T190000
UID:69fe1e91c7d3cd580057e447@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For Senior Safety Awareness Month\, Toronto Fire Services wil
 l be conducting a presentation on fire safety. Topics will include fire pr
 evention\, causes of home fires\, smoke & carbon monoxide alarms\, escape 
 planning for special needs\, fire safety in high-rise buildings\, etc. Q&
 A will follow.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Beeton Hall\, 1st floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fe1e91c7d3cd580057e447
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
