UID:69cd6aa4ad384e40edb837a3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively discussion of Tommy Orange's\nThere There
 \n.\nIntertwining the lives of various Native American characters as they 
 converge for the Big Oakland Powwow\, There There\nexplores issues of iden
 tity\, trauma and the complexities of urban Native American life.\nDrop-in
 .
LOCATION:Runnymede\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69cd6aa4ad384e40edb837a3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
